-- OD-04-02: enrollments_course.status has no value list. Reports test 'activo' and 'baja' (case-insensitive in
--           FileMaker finds); the auto-enter is 'ACTIVO'. The demo seeds ACTIVO/BAJA and compares with lower().
-- OD-04-03: registration.status auto-enters 'Nuevo', which is not in value list registration_status. Kept as written
--           (both allowed by the CHECK). Owner may drop 'Nuevo'.
